## Ifrit

Ifrits are a kind of genie, bodies of living fire, kin to the djinn. One kept the [[Org/Embercall Industries/index|Embercall]]'s works beneath northern [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]]: a figure of flame carrying a heavy curved sword whose reach is longer than a person's arm. Fire does not touch it; an artillery shell set off at its feet left it unharmed, though the blast shoved it back.
